Latar wingking.
Ing surya 15 Juli 2010, &lt;a href="20th%20Century%20Fox"&gt;Fox 2000 Pictures&lt;/a&gt; numbas hak cipta novel nèm-nèman &lt;a href="Before%20I%20Fall"&gt;Before I Fall&lt;/a&gt;, anggitan kapisanipun &lt;a href="Lauren%20Oliver"&gt;Lauren Oliver&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kababar ing taun 2010. &lt;a href="Maria%20Maggenti"&gt;Maria Maggenti&lt;/a&gt; lajeng dipunsuwun supados nyerat ambal arupi skénario filem, sawetawis Jonathan Shestack badhé kadhapuk minangka juru damel sesarengan kaliyan Ginny Pennekamp. Taun 2011, skénario sampun mlebet wonten pratelan ireng, ingkang ateges mboten badhé dipundamel. &lt;a href="Ry%20Russo-Young"&gt;Ry Russo-Young&lt;/a&gt; dipullebetaken minangka juru arah utawi sutradhara. Surya 15 September 2015 kawartosaken bilih &lt;a href="Zoey%20Deutch"&gt;Zoey Deutch&lt;/a&gt; ndhèrèk nggarap filem punika maragani minangka Amantha Kingston, nèm-nèman ing sekolah menengah atas. &lt;a href="Brian%20Robbins"&gt;Brian Robbins&lt;/a&gt; lan Matthew Kaplan badhe dados juru damel ing wewengkonipun Awesomeness Films, sesarengan Shestack, ingkang badhé kawiwitan wulan Oktober 2015. Ing surya 7 Oktober 2015, para paraga sanesipun dipunwartosaken badhé nyawiji antawisipun &lt;a href="Halston%20Sage"&gt;Halston Sage&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Logan%20Miller"&gt;Logan Miller&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kian%20Lawley"&gt;Kian Lawley&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Diego%20Boneta"&gt;Diego Boneta&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Elena%20Kampouris"&gt;Elena Kampouris&lt;/a&gt;. Good Universe badhé nanggeljawabi babagan pangedolan filem punika sadonya ing miyos &lt;a href="American%20Film%20Market"&gt;American Film Market&lt;/a&gt;. Surya 3 November 2015, &lt;a href="Jennifer%20Beals"&gt;Jennifer Beals&lt;/a&gt; nyawiji wonten proyek filem punika, maragani minangka ibu saking Samantha. Surya 20 November 2015, Liv Hewson kapracaya maragani minangka Anna Cartullo. Wonéné &lt;a href="Adam%20Taylor"&gt;Adam Taylor&lt;/a&gt; kajibah nggarap iringan komposisi musik kagem skor filem.
