<doc id="160621" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=160621" title="Rampage (filem 2018)">
Rampage (filem 2018)

Rampage nggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Film%20fiksi%20ilmiah"&gt;fiksi ilmiah&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kadamel taun 2018. Filem punika dipunarahaken déning Brad Peyton, adhedhasar saking seri &lt;a href="video%20game"&gt;video game&lt;/a&gt; kanthi sesirah ingkang sama, pakaryanipun Midway Games. Wondéné juru paraga ingkang kapracaya maragani filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="Dwayne%20Johnson"&gt;Dwayne Johnson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Naomie%20Harris"&gt;Naomie Harris&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Malin%20%C3%85kerman"&gt;Malin Åkerman&lt;/a&gt;, Jake Lacy, lan &lt;a href="Jeffrey%20Dean%20Morgan"&gt;Jeffrey Dean Morgan&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika nyariyosaken babagan setunggaling &lt;a href="Primatologi"&gt;ahli primata&lt;/a&gt; kang asma Davis Okoye, ingkang sesambetan karya kaliyan George, &lt;a href="gorila"&gt;gorila&lt;/a&gt; albino ingkang lajeng malih dados makhluk ganas kanthi ukuran ingkang ageng, ngamuk sasampunipun percobaan sembrono saperlu ngendheg kalih raseksa sanesipun.
Pamundhutan gambar kagem filem punika kawiwitan ing wulan April 2017 wonten &lt;a href="Chicago"&gt;Chicago&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika kababar ing &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; surya 11 April 2018 lan Amérikah Sarékat surya 13 April 2018, déning &lt;a href="Warner%20Bros."&gt;Warner Bros. Pictures&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="New%20Line%20Cinema"&gt;New Line Cinema&lt;/a&gt;, miyos format 2D, RealD 3D lan &lt;a href="IMAX"&gt;IMAX&lt;/a&gt;. Ing surya 19 April 2018, filem punika sampun kasil ngempalaken arta dumugi $178 yuta sadonya, ugi nampi pangalembana saking para juru kritik awit saking kaelokan Johnson lan Morgan wonten filem punika, sarta efek visualipun.
