Ready Player One nggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; fiksi ilmiah pangembaran saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dipundamel taun 2018. Filem punika dipunarahaken déning &lt;a href="Steven%20Spielberg"&gt;Steven Spielberg&lt;/a&gt; kadamel déning Steven Spielberg, Donald De Line, Dan Farah, lan &lt;a href="Kristie%20Macosko%20Krieger"&gt;Kristie Macosko Krieger&lt;/a&gt;. Skénario kagem filem punika kaanggit déning &lt;a href="Zak%20Penn"&gt;Zak Penn&lt;/a&gt; lan Ernest Cline adhedhasar saking &lt;a href="novel"&gt;novel&lt;/a&gt; sesirah Ready Player One anggitanipun Ernest Cline. Wondéné para juru paraga ingkang kapracaya maragani film punika antawisipun &lt;a href="Tye%20Sheridan"&gt;Tye Sheridan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Olivia%20Cooke"&gt;Olivia Cooke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ben%20Mendelsohn"&gt;Ben Mendelsohn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="T.J.%20Miller"&gt;T.J. Miller&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Simon%20Pegg"&gt;Simon Pegg&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Mark%20Rylance"&gt;Mark Rylance&lt;/a&gt;.
