Rio 2 nggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Film%20komedi"&gt;komedi&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Film%20petualangan"&gt;petualangan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Film%20musikal"&gt;musikal&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Film%20animasi%20komputer"&gt;animasi komputer&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Film%203D"&gt;3D&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kadamel taun 2014 déning &lt;a href="Blue%20Sky%20Studios"&gt;Blue Sky Studios&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika kaarahaken déning &lt;a href="Carlos%20Saldanha"&gt;Carlos Saldanha&lt;/a&gt;. Rio 2 dados filem kaping kalih sasampunipun &lt;a href="Rio%20%28film%29"&gt;Rio&lt;/a&gt; taun 2011 dan film pertama dari studio tersebut yang memiliki sekuel di luar &lt;a href="Ice%20Age%20%28waralaba%29"&gt;waralaba Ice Age&lt;/a&gt;. Sesirah ingkang dipunagem ngrujuk saking &lt;a href="Kutha"&gt;kitha&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Brasil"&gt;Brasil&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Rio%20de%20Janeiro%20%28kota%29"&gt;Rio de Janeiro&lt;/a&gt;, ing mriku filem kaping pisan dipunwiwiti, nanging cariyosipun kathah mundhut panggenan wonten alas udan &lt;a href="Hutan%20hujan%20Amazon"&gt;Amazon&lt;/a&gt;.
Wondéné para panyulih suwanten ingkang kadhapuk ing filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="Jesse%20Eisenberg"&gt;Jesse Eisenberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Anne%20Hathaway"&gt;Anne Hathaway&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="will.i.am"&gt;will.i.am&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jamie%20Foxx"&gt;Jamie Foxx&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="George%20Lopez"&gt;George Lopez&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tracy%20Morgan"&gt;Tracy Morgan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jemaine%20Clement"&gt;Jemaine Clement&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Leslie%20Mann"&gt;Leslie Mann&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rodrigo%20Santoro"&gt;Rodrigo Santoro&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Jake%20T.%20Austin"&gt;Jake T. Austin&lt;/a&gt;. Rio 2 dipunbabar kagem sagung pamirsa sadonya ing surya 20 Maret 2014, lan surya 11 April 2014, ing bioskop-bioskop Amerika. Rio 2 dados filem pungkasanipun &lt;a href="Don%20Rhymer"&gt;Don Rhymer&lt;/a&gt; sasampunipun piyambakipun séda 28 November 2012.
