Prau Ashigara (足柄, Prau Ashigara) iku prau dlajah abot klas Myōkō kang kaanggo nalika &lt;a href="Perang%20Donya%20II"&gt;Perang Donya II&lt;/a&gt; darbéné &lt;a href="Wadya%20Sagara%20Kamaharajan%20Jepang"&gt;Wadya Sagara Kamaharajan Jepang&lt;/a&gt;. Aran prau iki saka jenengé &lt;a href="Gunung%20Ashigara"&gt;Gunung Ashigara&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Pr%C3%A9f%C3%A8ktur%20Kanagawa"&gt;Préfèktur Kanagawa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pr%C3%A9f%C3%A8ktur%20Shizuoka"&gt;Préfèktur Shizuoka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;.
Ashigara kapernahaké rikala 11 April 1925 ing &lt;a href="Nagasaki"&gt;Nagasaki&lt;/a&gt; déning &lt;a href="Mitsubishi%20Heavy%20Industries"&gt;Mitsubishi Heavy Industries&lt;/a&gt;; banjur kababar rikala 22 April 1928. Prau iki kinepyakaké rikala 20 Agustus 1929 ing pamangkuné kolonèl Yaichi Ono. Prau iki kèrem rikala 8 Juni 1945 déning &lt;a href="HMS%26%2332%3BTrenchant%26%2332%3B%28P331%29"&gt;Trenchant&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Supitan%20Bangka"&gt;Supitan Bangka&lt;/a&gt; ().
