The Fighter (filem 2010)

The Fighter yaiku film biografi drama &lt;a href="Amerika"&gt;Amerika&lt;/a&gt; taun 2010 sing diarahake dening &lt;a href="David%20O.%20Russell"&gt;David O. Russell&lt;/a&gt; lan diprodhuksi dening &lt;a href="Dorothy%20Aufiero"&gt;Dorothy Aufiero&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="David%20Hoberman"&gt;David Hoberman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Todd%20Lieberman"&gt;Todd Lieberman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ryan%20Kavanaugh"&gt;Ryan Kavanaugh&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Paul%20Tamasy"&gt;Paul Tamasy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mark%20Wahlberg"&gt;Mark Wahlberg&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Darren%20Aronofsky"&gt;Darren Aronofsky&lt;/a&gt;. Film iki ditulis dening &lt;a href="Paul%20Tamasy"&gt;Paul Tamasy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Eric%20Johnson"&gt;Eric Johnson&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Scott%20Silver"&gt;Scott Silver&lt;/a&gt;, nalika crita ditulis dening &lt;a href="Keith%20Dorrington"&gt;Keith Dorrington&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paul%20Tamasy"&gt;Paul Tamasy&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Eric%20Johnson"&gt;Eric Johnson&lt;/a&gt;. Bintang film &lt;a href="Mark%20Wahlberg"&gt;Mark Wahlberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Christian%20Bale"&gt;Christian Bale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Amy%20Adams"&gt;Amy Adams&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Melissa%20Leo"&gt;Melissa Leo&lt;/a&gt;
