Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time

Pangeran Persia: Sands of Time (Basa Inggris: Prince of Persia: Sand Determining Time) yaiku film fantasi kang dirilis ing taun 2010, lan disusun dening &lt;a href="Jordan%20Mechner"&gt;Jordan Mechner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Boaz%20Yakin"&gt;Boaz Yakin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Doug%20Miro"&gt;Doug Miro&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Carlo%20Bernard"&gt;Carlo Bernard&lt;/a&gt;; katuntun dening &lt;a href="Mike%20Newell"&gt;Mike Newell&lt;/a&gt; ; diprodhuksi dening &lt;a href="Jerry%20Bruckheimer"&gt;Jerry Bruckheimer&lt;/a&gt; lan disebaraké déning &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Pictures"&gt;Walt Disney Pictures&lt;/a&gt;. Film iki ngrampungake game video 2003 saka jeneng sing padha, dikembangake lan dirilis dening Ubisoft Montreal.
