<doc id="160693" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=160693" title="Fast Five">
Fast Five

Fast Five (uga dikenal minangka Fast &amp; Furious 5 utawa FF &amp;nbsp; 5) yaiku film action taun 2011 kang critané ditulis dening &lt;a href="Chris%20Morgan"&gt;Chris Morgan&lt;/a&gt; lan disutradarai dening &lt;a href="Justin%20Lin"&gt;Justin Lin&lt;/a&gt;. Film iki minangka edisi kaping lima seri film &lt;a href="The%20Fast%20and%20the%20Furious"&gt;The Fast and the Furious&lt;/a&gt;.Juru paraga film kasebut yaiku &lt;a href="Vin%20Diesel"&gt;Vin Diesel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paul%20Walker"&gt;Paul Walker&lt;/a&gt;, Jordana Brewster lan Dwayne Johnson.Ditayangke pisanan ing Australia tanggal 20 April 2011 lan banjur diteruske dening Amerika Serikat tanggal 29 April 2011. Film iki nyeritani Brian O'Conner (Walker), Dominic Toretto (Diesel) lan Mia Toretto (Brewster) sing ngrancang nyolong 100 yuta dolar AS saka pengusaha Hernan Reyes (Joaquim de Almeida). Kajaba iku, dhèwèké uga diuber agen US DSS, Luke Hobbs (Johnson).
Fast Five nampa kasil sukses, bisa mecahke box office, lan uga bisa ngalahake film sadurunge, Fast &amp;amp;amp; Furious (2009). Nganti 15 Agustus 2011, film iki wis entuk 605 yuta dolar AS.
