<doc id="160735" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=160735" title="The Fifth Estate">
The Fifth Estate

The Fifth Estate nggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="biografi"&gt;biografi&lt;/a&gt; thriller India-Amerika ingkang kadamel taun 2013. Filem punika dipunarahaken déning &lt;a href="Bill%20Condon"&gt;Bill Condon&lt;/a&gt; adhedhasar saking skénario anggitanipun Josh Singer, kaangkat saking Inside WikiLeaks pakaryanipun Daniel Dlscheit-Berk. Filem ingkang nyariyosaken pandungkapan dhokumen rahasia &lt;a href="WikiLeaks"&gt;WikiLeaks&lt;/a&gt; punika dipunparagani déning &lt;a href="Benedict%20Cumberbatch"&gt;Benedict Cumberbatch&lt;/a&gt; minangka direktur, &lt;a href="Julian%20Assange"&gt;Julian Assange&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Daniel%20Br%C3%BChl"&gt;Daniel Brühl&lt;/a&gt; minangka manten juru wicara, &lt;a href="Daniel%20Domscheit-Berg"&gt;Daniel Domscheit-Berg&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Anthony%20Mackie"&gt;Anthony Mackie&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="David%20Thewlis"&gt;David Thewlis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Alicia%20Vikander"&gt;Alicia Vikander&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Stanley%20Tucci"&gt;Stanley Tucci&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Laura%20Linney"&gt;Laura Linney&lt;/a&gt; minangka paraga panyokong.
Filem punika dipundamel déning &lt;a href="DreamWorks%20Pictures"&gt;DreamWorks Pictures&lt;/a&gt; lan Participant Media, The Fifth Estate kagiyaraken kaping pisanipun nalika adicara &lt;a href="Toronto%20International%20Film%20Festival"&gt;Toronto International Film Festival&lt;/a&gt; taun 2013. Lajeng kababar ing bioskop déning &lt;a href="Touchstone%20Pictures"&gt;Touchstone Pictures&lt;/a&gt; kagem sagung pamirsa ing Amérikah Sarékat ing surya 8 Oktober 2013 Sawetawis, pangeduman internasional kapérang antawis &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Studios%20Motion%20Pictures"&gt;Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, Reliance Entertainment, lan Mister Smith Entertainment. Filem niki sèstu jeblok ing tataran box office. Kanthi ardhana $28 yuta, namung kasil ngempalaken $8,6 yuta
