Ice Age: Continental Drift

Ice Age: Continental Drift yaiku film ing 3D, petualangan, lan komedi &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;ing Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 2012, Disutradarani dening Steve Martino lan Mike Thurmeier. Film iki ditulis dening Jason Fuchs lan Michael Berg, lan panyulih swarane yaiku dening Ray Romano, &lt;a href="John%20Leguizamo"&gt;John Leguizamo&lt;/a&gt;, Denis Leary, Nicki Minaj, Drake, &lt;a href="Jennifer%20Lopez"&gt;Jennifer Lopez&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Queen%20Latifah"&gt;Ratu Latifah&lt;/a&gt;.
